# The buffer alone. `allocate-utf-8` and fourteen methods (the case changes, the trims, `split`, `replace`) were
# declared here with no body, and nothing called them: a call could only have reached a stub. They were removed on
# 2026-10-05, when a task with no body anywhere in the build became an error. The text work is `@term/base/text`'s.
form text-utf-8-hold
  link list
    like list
      like u8
    mark private
